    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "Paquita, ahora todo va vía link.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Paquita, everything goes by link nowadays.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Y eso qué es? ¿El ordenador?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what is that? The computer?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "Internet.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The Internet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Y de eso tenemos?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And do we have any of that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "PS Management busca a la actriz tres sesenta.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'PS Management is looking for the three-sixty actress.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "No cabe.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It doesn't fit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Cómo que no cabe?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean it doesn't fit?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "Esta aplicación tiene un máximo de palabras.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This app has a word limit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Quién nos sigue?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who follows us?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "De momento, nada.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing so far.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "No me gusta mucho el vinagre.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't really like vinegar.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "La sal es muy mala. Yo la sal la estoy dejando también.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Salt is very bad. I'm giving up salt too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
